# Read by `vite` in DEV mode only (`npm run dev` / `npm run dev:harness`), never
# by `vite build`, and excluded from `civitai app submit`'s upload.
#
# The dev harness posts its fake BLOCK_INIT from the dev server's own origin, and
# the bridge drops any message whose origin is not on this list — so without
# this line `npm run dev:harness` sits on the boot skeleton. Port 5173 is pinned
# with `strictPort` in vite.config.ts so this value cannot drift.
VITE_BLOCK_ALLOWED_PARENT_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
